    "incident_title": "Checkout failures ~20% since shortly after 14:00 UTC",
    "outcome": "conclusive",
    "summary": "Checkout failures started at the checkout-svc v2.14.0 rollout (deployed 14:01, 100% at 14:04). The new formatPrice reads cart.currency.code, but carts still on the legacy cart_schema v1 have no currency object, so formatPrice throws a TypeError and the checkout returns 5xx. v1 carts are about 22.4% of active carts, which matches the ~21\u201322% checkout 5xx rate. v2 carts succeed (200 OK). Downstream services (payments-svc, orders-db) show no degradation. Recommended immediate mitigation: roll checkout-svc back to v2.13.2 with deployctl, then fix formatPrice to guard against a missing currency and complete the v1\u2192v2 cart migration (CART-212).",
    "root_cause": "Regression in checkout-svc v2.14.0 (multi-currency price formatting): formatPrice dereferences cart.currency.code without a null check. Carts with cart_schema=v1 (about 22.4% of active carts, per the WARN log) lack the currency object, so every checkout for those carts throws TypeError at src/pricing/format.ts:41 and returns an error. The error rate rose from ~0.2% to ~21\u201322% immediately after the 14:01\u201314:04 rollout.",
